---
/**
 * @category Hero
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Hero
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 p-2 md:p-3 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='relative flex flex-col'>
    <img class='order-last mt-2 block aspect-[4/5] h-auto w-full rounded-[1.25rem] object-cover object-[70%_50%] md:absolute md:inset-0 md:order-none md:mt-0 md:aspect-auto md:h-full md:rounded-[2rem]' src='/assets/images/content/hero-bg.webp' alt='Astronaut odpočívající na červené duně a zvedající zapálenou signální světlice' width='2880' height='1620' />
    <div class='relative flex flex-col items-start gap-6 px-3 pt-8 md:min-h-[44rem] md:px-12 md:pt-12 xl:min-h-[50rem] xl:px-16 xl:pt-16'>
      <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-8 items-center rounded-full bg-sky-100 px-3 font-sans text-sm font-medium text-sky-800 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-sky-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sky-800 md:hover:bg-white md:focus-visible:outline-white dark:bg-sky-950 dark:text-sky-200 md:dark:bg-sky-100 md:dark:text-sky-800'>Dnes z pece</a>
      <h1 class='m-0 max-w-[11ch] font-sans text-[3rem] font-semibold leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.045em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:text-[5.5rem] md:text-white xl:text-[8rem] dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:text-white'>Chléb z pece</h1>
    </div>
    <div class='relative flex flex-col gap-6 px-3 pb-6 pt-6 md:absolute md:-bottom-px md:-left-px md:w-[29rem] md:rounded-tr-[2rem] md:bg-stone-50 md:pb-2 md:pl-12 md:pr-10 md:pt-10 xl:w-[33rem] xl:pl-16 md:dark:bg-stone-900'>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty dark:text-stone-400'>Každé ráno pečeme kváskový chleba, koláče a něco sladkého ke kávě. Zastavte se v pekárně Na Růžku, nebo si objednejte dort na víkend.</p>
      <div class='flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row'>
        <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-yellow-400 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-yellow-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-yellow-400'>Objednat dort</a>
        <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-6 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Otevírací doba</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
